## 集合 widget（ListView）

传统方案中，显示列表需要 `RemoteViewsService` + `RemoteViewsFactory`：

```kotlin
class TodoWidgetService : RemoteViewsService() {
    override fun onGetViewFactory(intent: Intent): RemoteViewsFactory {
        return TodoViewsFactory(this.applicationContext, intent)
    }
}

class TodoViewsFactory(
    private val context: Context,
    intent: Intent
) : RemoteViewsService.RemoteViewsFactory {

    private val appWidgetId = intent.getIntExtra(
        AppWidgetManager.EXTRA_APPWIDGET_ID,
        AppWidgetManager.INVALID_APPWIDGET_ID
    )
    private var items: List<TodoItem> = emptyList()

    override fun onCreate() {
        items = TodoRepository.getTopTodos(10)
    }

    override fun onDataSetChanged() {
        items = TodoRepository.getTopTodos(10)
    }

    override fun getViewAt(position: Int): RemoteViews {
        val item = items[position]
        val views = RemoteViews(context.packageName, R.layout.widget_list_item)
        views.setTextViewText(R.id.item_title, item.title)
        views.setImageViewResource(
            R.id.item_icon,
            if (item.isComplete) R.drawable.ic_check else R.drawable.ic_uncheck
        )
        return views
    }

    override fun getCount() = items.size
    override fun getViewTypeCount() = 1
    override fun getItemId(position: Int) = position.toLong()
    override fun hasStableIds() = true
    override fun onDestroy() {}
    override fun getLoadingView(): RemoteViews? = null
}
```

---

## 小结

- Android widget 有两代方案：传统 `AppWidgetProvider` + `RemoteViews`，现代 `Jetpack Glance`
- `RemoteViews` 只支持有限的视图类型，自定义 View 需要通过 `drawBitmap` 等方式变通
- `updatePeriodMillis` 最小间隔为 30 分钟，更频繁的更新需要 `WorkManager` 或推送触发
- Glance 提供声明式 Compose 语法、`SizeMode.Responsive` 尺寸适配和 per-GlanceId 状态持久化
- 集合 widget（列表）在传统方案中通过 `RemoteViewsService` + `RemoteViewsFactory` 实现
- `resizeMode` 控制 widget 是否可调整大小，`widgetCategory` 控制显示位置

相关内容请参阅 [iOS WidgetKit 开发](1_widgetkit-ios.md) 和 [小组件生命周期与刷新](3_widget-lifecycle.md)。
